  "prefLabel": "Pda 101.28 Portsmouth pier berthing area",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 101.28 “Portsmouth pier berthing area” means the area(s) of the state-owned commercial pier and associated facilities located at Portsmouth and designated by the division director or designee for the berthing of vessels.\n\nSource. #8760, eff 11-18-06",
